WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.100
- So back to why Bill Cosby is going free.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.760
So it's no surprise that
Constand was successful

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.593
in the civil suit,

00:00:04.593 --> 00:00:06.285
but later the District
Attorneys changed their mind

00:00:06.285 --> 00:00:07.710
and went forward with

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.720
a criminal prosecution of Cosby.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.425
And during that criminal prosecution,

00:00:11.425 --> 00:00:13.228
they used the deposition testimony

00:00:13.228 --> 00:00:15.770
that came out in the Constand civil suit.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:17.470
This was effectively an end run around

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.330
the Fifth Amendment right
against self-incrimination.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.720
They were able to use his
testimony against him,

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.880
despite the prior promise not to.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:24.713
And Fifth Amendment rights

00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:26.860
against self-incrimination
are incredibly important.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.693
They're so important,

00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:30.060
that's why police have
to Mirandize suspects

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.460
before they are able to take statements

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.930
when they are interogating them.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:34.763
And again,

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:35.596
this is a complicated issue,

00:00:35.596 --> 00:00:37.510
but effectively the Supreme
Court of Pennsylvania says

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.370
that you cannot induce someone

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:40.740
to waive their Fifth Amendment rights

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.750
against self-incrimination

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.080
and then use their testimony against them

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.430
in a criminal prosecution.

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:46.480
You can't trick someone

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.000
to waive their Fifth Amendment rights.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.860
Bill Cosby is not innocent,

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.460
but these rights exist for

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:54.157
a reason and they have
to apply to every one.

